      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get it. i just cant deal with the pain right now and i really dont want to mess with antibiotics since my kidneys are sensitive. i have a ton of vitamin C at home... would taking a really high dose of that help flush the infection out instead? would that be safer for my kidneys than the macrobid?",
